# The keys whose signature makes a plugin an official one, compiled into storageforge-agent and storageforge-agentctl (build.rs).
# The format is ssh-keygen's allowed-signers file, one key a line, ed25519 only, and the namespace has to be named:
#
#   storageforge namespaces="storageforge-plugin" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
#
# There is no key here yet: the owner holds the release key and adds its public half. A program built from this file as it is
# trusts no release key and so runs no official plugin, and says so (`storageforge-agent anchors`).
